      <w>1860</w>
      <h>70</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>The caller only sees the LlmClient interface. For a conversation with a local model, LlmClientFactory returns a
LangChain4jClient wrapping an Ollama ChatModel, without the decorators, because nothing leaves the computer. A conversation
never changes model, so text a local model saw can't reach a cloud model through the conversation history.
bg=white
layer=2</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
